npm notice run generator-jhipster@9.4.0 update-snapshots
npm notice run esmocha test generators cli .blueprint lib --forbid-only --update-snapshot --enable-source-maps


  generator - base - support - timestamp
    ::parseChangelog
      when not passing parameters
        ✔ throws (5ms)
      when passing a number
        ✔ throws (1ms)
      when passing an invalid changelogDate
        ✔ throws (1ms)
      when passing a valid changelogDate
        ✔ returns a date object (1ms)
        ✔ returns the date (1ms)


  generator - base - internal - blueprint
    ::parseBlueprints
      ✔ does nothing if an array (2ms)
      ✔ returns an array if empty string (1ms)
      ✔ returns an array if not string
      ✔ adds generator-jhipster prefix if it is absent (1ms)
      ✔ keeps generator-jhipster prefix if it is present
      ✔ adds generator-jhipster prefix to scoped package and extracts version
      ✔ parses comma separated list
    ::mergeBlueprints
      not passing arguments
        ✔ returns an empty array
      passing undefined
        ✔ throws an error (4ms)
      passing array and undefined
        ✔ throws an error (1ms)
      passing unique blueprints
        ✔ returns them concatenated
      passing non unique blueprints
        ✔ prefers prior version
        ✔ uses later version when prior version is not defined
    ::removeBlueprintDuplicates
      ✔ keeps blueprints with undefined version


